---
/**
 * University signature line bar.
 *
 * The SIUE signature line is the PRIMARY brand identifier for this site
 * (Philip Sherrill, Director of Creative and Design, UMC, 2026-09-11), and the
 * Visual Identity Requirements (p.8) require it on official University
 * websites, upper left (p.10). The lab and department are identified through
 * page content and hierarchy instead of through a mark of their own.
 *
 * It sits in its own band ABOVE the site nav on purpose. Departments and units
 * may not place their names above, below or alongside the signature line except
 * through an officially approved lockup (p.7), so "AURA Lab" must not sit
 * adjacent to it. The band and the clearspace keep the institutional mark and
 * the site name visibly separate.
 *
 * Layout (2026-09-15): the mark shares the page container with the nav so the
 * two left edges align, and the band is only as tall as the clearspace needs.
 * Clearspace (p.19): no page element enters a margin equal to the height of
 * the signature line. Rendered at 26px tall with 26px of padding above and
 * below; the container gutter supplies the horizontal clearspace.
 *
 * Artwork is the official file, unmodified, from
 * siue.edu/marketing-and-communications/services/graphic-design/wordmarks-for-download.shtml
 * Never redraw, recolour or crop it.
 */
---

<div class="siue-bar">
  <div class="container-page">
    <a class="siue-bar__link" href="https://www.siue.edu" aria-label="Southern Illinois University Edwardsville home">
      <img
        class="siue-bar__mark siue-bar__mark--light"
        src="/img/siue-signature-line-black.png"
        alt="Southern Illinois University Edwardsville"
        width="1155" height="251" />
      <img
        class="siue-bar__mark siue-bar__mark--dark"
        src="/img/siue-signature-line-white.png"
        alt="Southern Illinois University Edwardsville"
        width="720" height="156" />
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .siue-bar {
    background: var(--paper);
    padding-block: 26px 0;
  }
  .siue-bar__link {
    display: inline-block;
    line-height: 0;
    /* The clearspace below the mark is the bar's bottom padding; keeping it on
       the link means the container gutter alone sets the horizontal inset. */
    padding-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .siue-bar__link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .siue-bar__mark {
    height: 26px;
    width: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  /* Light is the default; dark swaps in via the theme attribute or the OS. */
  .siue-bar__mark--dark { display: none; }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .siue-bar__mark--light { display: none; }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .siue-bar__mark--dark { display: block; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) .siue-bar__mark--light { display: none; }
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) .siue-bar__mark--dark { display: block; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .siue-bar { padding-block: 22px 0; }
    .siue-bar__link { padding-bottom: 22px; }
    .siue-bar__mark { height: 22px; }
  }
</style>
